sequenceDiagram
    participant U as User
    participant UI as Dialogue Workbench
    participant PS as ProbeSessionService
    participant RO as RecallOrchestrator
    participant TS as RecallTraceStore
    participant AS as ProbeAssessmentService
    participant RV as HumanReviewService
    participant ED as EpistemicDriveEngine

    U->>UI: Ask or select probe question
    UI->>PS: AskAsync(sessionId, text, intent)
    PS->>RO: RecallAsync(project, query, access, trace=true)
    RO->>TS: Save recall trace
    RO-->>PS: RecallResult + context pack
    PS->>AS: Assess answer, confidence, source state
    AS-->>PS: Findings and suggested actions
    PS-->>UI: Answer + trace id + findings
    UI-->>U: Show answer and trace panel
    U->>UI: Confirm / correct / mark missing / wrong scope
    UI->>PS: SubmitFeedbackAsync
    PS->>RV: Create review item when required
    PS->>ED: Publish probe evidence refs
    PS-->>UI: Feedback result with created evidence/test ids
